WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.480
It's February 15.

00:00:02.480 --> 00:00:03.840
I have been trapped
in an elevator.

00:00:03.840 --> 00:00:06.300
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:12.700 --> 00:00:14.830
Looking forward to
the long weekend?

00:00:14.830 --> 00:00:18.010
Valentine's Day and President's
Day, how often do you get that?

00:00:18.010 --> 00:00:19.180
It's like the
perfect storm, right?

00:00:19.180 --> 00:00:21.260
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:25.275
Did we just stop?

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:26.249
Hello?

00:00:26.249 --> 00:00:28.690
Help!

00:00:28.690 --> 00:00:30.610
There has to be security guards.

00:00:30.610 --> 00:00:32.650
Where are they?

00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.710
We're locked in
this box, but we're

00:00:35.710 --> 00:00:38.430
still a million miles apart.

00:00:38.430 --> 00:00:40.462
I'm an extremely private person.

00:00:40.462 --> 00:00:42.922
You don't even know me.

00:00:42.922 --> 00:00:43.906
[GLASS BREAKING]

00:00:43.906 --> 00:00:47.840
We'll be fine because we're
honest with each other.

00:00:47.840 --> 00:00:49.700
We've been in here for days.

00:00:49.700 --> 00:00:51.029
Get me out of here, please!

00:00:51.029 --> 00:00:53.524
[MUSIC PLAYING]

00:00:56.020 --> 00:00:57.480
Happy fucking Valentine's Day.

00:00:57.480 --> 00:01:00.230
[MUSIC PLAYING]

